Correction: $14+N$ divisible by 3. $14+1=15$ ($N=1$ odd), $14+4=18$ ($N=4$ even), $14+7=21$ ($N=7$ odd). So $N=4$ is the only even digit. My previous thought about 8 was a calculation error on the sum.

